  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf91808e2e971ad58f2a7f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打认识你以来，\n你就一直这副热血笨蛋的模样……\n不累吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0c41ae13645f9dc1d5c07ef377a1115ba68021c515b389ac9b30823f08b402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48648b909df0aae4975c674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不是很喜欢这种规规矩矩的衣服啊……\n不过，制服的话……还不错吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db2e7702b6ff527bca39706158abcb77afc2f4892e4cc2713e8206de5a620b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a4dbfe6e05e8342d4708c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人都穿着一样的衣服……感觉好微妙。\n……感觉会被大块头的家伙埋没……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ce891c8a93dee3fed0bd77e8788161f86cb6d0f522869d70f9ef83560a5e825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917a88cdbac7315088c06a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服……只属于我的——\r\n喂，你在笑什么啊？不准笑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "573148d6954923489476e6db7c0ad7fe22342a63343fdf25dd5c671d93545993",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e71669e4072b3894ce01f2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要长高了的话，再换下制服的尺寸吧。\n……要是你敢说没有必要的话，我可就踹你了哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57df5cebac67cce014d00241aee7af2f347f6acaa21692f1b6f87966500c0f5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1923e81f83e1553ca5645b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不大喜欢引人注目……\n但Live还是会好好做的。是我获胜的证明嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94b2d0bf8d577f7a17b1c4b562f4fc468cc6114fb4a1c5a8ed833e039e8f200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ceb0d3d2e9834d5aaa4920a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从来没有在追求可爱什么的哦？\n这才是我的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe98dcd7e321931abaf708aed3a611b935e081033be417d1c13acc74924fd33e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bea4b8285d7a91b71e107abd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咋了？你也需要被修理一下？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac80782c8e05019d57d4ec6f638216abe68be6852a90ef8449c2fca478032024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8473ca2a7e807d5985c36a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以后还能拍广告吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9462fd9181b83c70e8940fefefd809862d6b7827e01c400ce325a030b99e0693",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70618fd9e622e6a77d82a935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7906d7812e6b33a670c4ea8b4126e86b831de56f63384f7c84c1c1867e29e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3da8d5550d6f2b206679129e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会输",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c2e3b1d235dfff8a2590924445994133b495e456de37d7970a48c3017d1b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b41cbf3bfc7621f1a282aa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん…やっぱこういう服のが楽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7d696a2675c471dd778a50265bac97ed2678fdb73bec91823137b8c725c5cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1d15597f0c17ef7b0104d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "薄着は苦手。いちいち『もっと食え』\r\nとか言われて面倒だし…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbf684e007f17e4d44c467e41d9ecfeb4be7ebd98c99c20f3e8452b19f444d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5c150aa1020d86445c4896e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロールアウト後は性能チェックしないと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2b4b31dec536628e2f77d9afc3e9d1946946a63c4c9854b7dfc4542c4c0da4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d781f9e4266c964ed62b31c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "派手に勝つから、服もこれくらいがいいでしょ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd19cc70dc93fa4f13ba1f37f1854469e82cba5be2eafc41bf5fef2352c7c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
